        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart LR\n\n%% =========================================================\n%% ACTORS\n%% =========================================================\n\nMember[\&quot;👤 Member\&quot;]\nReceptionist[\&quot;👤 Receptionist\&quot;]\nCoach[\&quot;👤 Coach\&quot;]\nManager[\&quot;👤 Center Manager\&quot;]\n\nMoMo[\&quot;💳 MoMo Payment Gateway\&quot;]\nAI[\&quot;🤖 AI Service\&quot;]\n\n\n%% =========================================================\n%% SYSTEM BOUNDARY\n%% =========================================================\n\nsubgraph SYS[\&quot;SPORTS CENTER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM\&quot;]\n\n    %% ---------------- ACCOUNT ----------------\n\n    UC01([\&quot;UC01&lt;br/&gt;Register Account\&quot;])\n    UC02([\&quot;UC02&lt;br/&gt;Update Personal Information\&quot;])\n\n    %% ---------------- USER MANAGEMENT ----------------\n\n    UC03([\&quot;UC03&lt;br/&gt;Manage Member Information\&quot;])\n    UC04([\&quot;UC04&lt;br/&gt;Manage Coach Information\&quot;])\n    UC05([\&quot;UC05&lt;br/&gt;Manage Receptionist Information\&quot;])\n\n    %% ---------------- MEMBERSHIP ----------------\n\n    UC06([\&quot;UC06&lt;br/&gt;Manage Membership Packages\&quot;])\n    UC07([\&quot;UC07&lt;br/&gt;View Membership Packages\&quot;])\n    UC08([\&quot;UC08&lt;br/&gt;Register / Renew Membership\&quot;])\n    UC09([\&quot;UC09&lt;br/&gt;View Membership Status\&quot;])\n    UC10([\&quot;UC10&lt;br/&gt;Membership Expiration Notification\&quot;])\n\n    %% ---------------- CLASS &amp; SCHEDULE ----------------\n\n    UC11([\&quot;UC11&lt;br/&gt;Manage Sports\&quot;])\n    UC12([\&quot;UC12&lt;br/&gt;Manage Classes\&quot;])\n    UC13([\&quot;UC13&lt;br/&gt;Manage Training Rooms\&quot;])\n    UC14([\&quot;UC14&lt;br/&gt;Manage Operating Schedules\&quot;])\n    UC15([\&quot;UC15&lt;br/&gt;Manage Class Schedules\&quot;])\n    UC16([\&quot;UC16&lt;br/&gt;Assign Coach to Class\&quot;])\n\n    UC17([\&quot;UC17&lt;br/&gt;View Available Classes\&quot;])\n    UC18([\&quot;UC18&lt;br/&gt;Register for Class\&quot;])\n    UC19([\&quot;UC19&lt;br/&gt;Cancel Class Registration\&quot;])\n    UC20([\&quot;UC20&lt;br/&gt;View Personal Training Schedule\&quot;])\n    UC21([\&quot;UC21&lt;br/&gt;View Coach Information\&quot;])\n\n    UC22([\&quot;UC22&lt;br/&gt;View Teaching Schedule\&quot;])\n    UC23([\&quot;UC23&lt;br/&gt;View Assigned Class\&quot;])\n    UC24([\&quot;UC24&lt;br/&gt;View Class Member List\&quot;])\n\n    UC25([\&quot;UC25&lt;br/&gt;Class Schedule Notification\&quot;])\n    UC26([\&quot;UC26&lt;br/&gt;Schedule Change Notification\&quot;])\n\n    %% ---------------- PAYMENT ----------------\n\n    UC27([\&quot;UC27&lt;br/&gt;Create Membership Payment\&quot;])\n    UC28([\&quot;UC28&lt;br/&gt;Process Membership Payment\&quot;])\n    UC29([\&quot;UC29&lt;br/&gt;Record Membership Payment\&quot;])\n    UC30([\&quot;UC30&lt;br/&gt;View Payment Information\&quot;])\n    UC31([\&quot;UC31&lt;br/&gt;Generate Invoice\&quot;])\n    UC32([\&quot;UC32&lt;br/&gt;Print / Export Invoice\&quot;])\n\n    %% ---------------- REPORT ----------------\n\n    UC33([\&quot;UC33&lt;br/&gt;View Member &amp; Membership Report\&quot;])\n    UC34([\&quot;UC34&lt;br/&gt;View Class Registration Report\&quot;])\n    UC35([\&quot;UC35&lt;br/&gt;View Revenue Report\&quot;])\n\n    %% ---------------- RECEPTION ----------------\n\n    UC36([\&quot;UC36&lt;br/&gt;Search Member\&quot;])\n    UC37([\&quot;UC37&lt;br/&gt;Register New Member at Reception\&quot;])\n    UC38([\&quot;UC38&lt;br/&gt;Register / Renew Membership for Member\&quot;])\n    UC39([\&quot;UC39&lt;br/&gt;Check Member Membership Status\&quot;])\n    UC40([\&quot;UC40&lt;br/&gt;Record Member Attendance\&quot;])\n    UC41([\&quot;UC41&lt;br/&gt;Register / Cancel Member Class\&quot;])\n    UC42([\&quot;UC42&lt;br/&gt;Record Support Request\&quot;])\n\n    %% ---------------- TRAINING &amp; ATTENDANCE ----------------\n\n    UC43([\&quot;UC43&lt;br/&gt;View Member Training Information\&quot;])\n    UC44([\&quot;UC44&lt;br/&gt;Create Training Plan\&quot;])\n    UC45([\&quot;UC45&lt;br/&gt;Record Training Result\&quot;])\n    UC46([\&quot;UC46&lt;br/&gt;Evaluate Member Progress\&quot;])\n    UC47([\&quot;UC47&lt;br/&gt;Record Training Attendance\&quot;])\n\n    UC48([\&quot;UC48&lt;br/&gt;View Attendance History\&quot;])\n    UC49([\&quot;UC49&lt;br/&gt;View Training Results\&quot;])\n    UC50([\&quot;UC50&lt;br/&gt;View Training Plans\&quot;])\n    UC51([\&quot;UC51&lt;br/&gt;View Coach Comments\&quot;])\n\n    UC52([\&quot;UC52&lt;br/&gt;Send Training Notification / Homework\&quot;])\n\n    %% ---------------- AI ----------------\n\n    UC53([\&quot;UC53&lt;br/&gt;Request AI Workout Recommendation\&quot;])\n    UC54([\&quot;UC54&lt;br/&gt;Generate Exercise Recommendation\&quot;])\n\n    UC55([\&quot;UC55&lt;br/&gt;Ask AI Assistant\&quot;])\n\n    %% ---------------- SYSTEM MANAGEMENT ----------------\n\n    UC56([\&quot;UC56&lt;br/&gt;Manage Access Permissions\&quot;])\n    UC57([\&quot;UC57&lt;br/&gt;View System Activity History\&quot;])\n\nend\n\n\n%% =========================================================\n%% MEMBER\n%% =========================================================\n\nMember --- UC01\nMember --- UC02\n\nMember --- UC07\nMember --- UC08\nMember --- UC09\nMember --- UC10\n\nMember --- UC17\nMember --- UC18\nMember --- UC19\nMember --- UC20\nMember --- UC21\nMember --- UC25\nMember --- UC26\n\nMember --- UC30\n\nMember --- UC48\nMember --- UC49\nMember --- UC50\nMember --- UC51\n\nMember --- UC55\n\n\n%% =========================================================\n%% RECEPTIONIST\n%% =========================================================\n\nReceptionist --- UC03\nReceptionist --- UC09\n\nReceptionist --- UC36\nReceptionist --- UC37\nReceptionist --- UC38\nReceptionist --- UC39\nReceptionist --- UC40\nReceptionist --- UC41\nReceptionist --- UC42\n\nReceptionist --- UC29\nReceptionist --- UC30\nReceptionist --- UC31\nReceptionist --- UC32\n\n\n%% =========================================================\n%% COACH\n%% =========================================================\n\nCoach --- UC22\nCoach --- UC23\nCoach --- UC24\n\nCoach --- UC43\nCoach --- UC44\nCoach --- UC45\nCoach --- UC46\nCoach --- UC47\nCoach --- UC52\n\nCoach --- UC53\n\n\n%% =========================================================\n%% CENTER MANAGER\n%% =========================================================\n\nManager --- UC03\nManager --- UC04\nManager --- UC05\n\nManager --- UC06\n\nManager --- UC11\nManager --- UC12\nManager --- UC13\nManager --- UC14\nManager --- UC15\nManager --- UC16\n\nManager --- UC33\nManager --- UC34\nManager --- UC35\n\nManager --- UC56\nManager --- UC57\n\n\n%% =========================================================\n%% EXTERNAL ACTORS\n%% =========================================================\n\nMoMo --- UC28\nAI --- UC54\nAI --- UC55\n\n\n%% =========================================================\n%% INCLUDE RELATIONSHIPS\n%% =========================================================\n\nUC08 -.-&gt;|&lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;| UC07\nUC08 -.-&gt;|&lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;| UC27\nUC08 -.-&gt;|&lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;| UC28\n\nUC27 -.-&gt;|&lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;| UC28\nUC28 -.-&gt;|&lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;| UC29\n\nUC29 -.-&gt;|&lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;| UC31\n\nUC32 -.-&gt;|&lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;| UC31\n\nUC18 -.-&gt;|&lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;| UC17\nUC19 -.-&gt;|&lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;| UC17\n\nUC15 -.-&gt;|&lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;| UC16\n\nUC38 -.-&gt;|&lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;| UC36\nUC41 -.-&gt;|&lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;| UC36\n\nUC44 -.-&gt;|&lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;| UC43\nUC45 -.-&gt;|&lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;| UC43\nUC46 -.-&gt;|&lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;| UC43\nUC47 -.-&gt;|&lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;| UC43\n\nUC53 -.-&gt;|&lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;| UC54\n\n\n%% =========================================================\n%% EXTEND RELATIONSHIPS\n%% ======================